  "description": "Bean qou-6gf9. Reads CAL-2 m_mu/m_e = Vol(4_1)/hbar_q^2 literally as the leading term of the Andersen-Hansen/Ohtsuki log-series of the 4_1 Kashaev invariant [murakami-h2011]; leading-term matching forces N_eff = 2 pi/hbar_q^2 ~ 640.02. Every derived correction term is evaluated at the proton pin with NO adjustment. The one-loop term (3/2)log N - (1/4)log 3 = +9.42 moves m_mu UP by ~4.6e7 ppb; all five identified Ohtsuki rungs are positive and also move it UP. The measured residual needs the carrier DOWN by 211 ppb. Exact log J_N at N=640,641 matches the series to the kappa_6 scale, so the expansion is the right one at this N. Scope (b) for the class 'finite truncation of the 4_1 Kashaev log-series with non-negative rungs' (Lean kashaev_reading_excluded); CAL-2 unchanged.",
